-- the electric energy of a unit charge pair at a and b, in units of the line's own (Kirchhoff, 1847):
-- the trees with a and b identified over the trees
eff-resistance : Nat → List FaradayLine → Nat → Nat → QP
eff-resistance n ls a b = (spanning-trees (monus n (suc zero)) (identify-ends a b ls) , spanning-trees n ls)
